000100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000200 PROGRAM-ID. QUALIFY.
000300 DATA DIVISION.
000400 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
000500*    the corpus shape: same names in different control blocks
000600 01  MB-FTL.
000700     05  WS-MODULE-NAME  PIC X(8) VALUE 'FTL'.
000800     05  WS-CALL-MODE    PIC X    VALUE 'K'.
000900 01  MB-LTF.
001000     05  WS-MODULE-NAME  PIC X(8) VALUE 'LTF'.
001100     05  WS-CALL-MODE    PIC X    VALUE 'D'.
001200*    three deep, so a qualifier can skip a level
001300 01  OUTER-A.
001400     05  MID-LEVEL.
001500         10  LEAF  PIC X(2) VALUE 'A1'.
001600 01  OUTER-B.
001700     05  MID-LEVEL.
001800         10  LEAF  PIC X(2) VALUE 'B2'.
001900 01  OUT-N  PIC X(8) VALUE SPACES.
002000 01  OUT-L  PIC X(2) VALUE SPACES.
002100 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
002200 MAIN-PARA.
002300     MOVE WS-MODULE-NAME OF MB-FTL TO OUT-N.
002400     DISPLAY 'A [' OUT-N ']'.
002500     MOVE WS-MODULE-NAME IN MB-LTF TO OUT-N.
002600     DISPLAY 'B [' OUT-N ']'.
002700     DISPLAY 'C [' WS-CALL-MODE OF MB-FTL ']'.
002800     DISPLAY 'D [' WS-CALL-MODE OF MB-LTF ']'.
002900*    skipping MID-LEVEL entirely
003000     MOVE LEAF OF OUTER-A TO OUT-L.
003100     DISPLAY 'E [' OUT-L ']'.
003200*    and naming every level
003300     MOVE LEAF OF MID-LEVEL OF OUTER-B TO OUT-L.
003400     DISPLAY 'F [' OUT-L ']'.
003500     STOP RUN.
